                  },
                  "linkStyle": {
                    "inherit": true,
                    "linkColor": "#514293",
                    "linkHoverColor": "#514293",
                    "linkUnderline": true,
                    "linkHoverUnderline": true
                  },
                  "text": "I’m so glad you’re here.<br><br>I’m Rosa, an abstract painter making original work about home, balance and belonging. I use natural pigments, handmade paints and archival materials, so each piece brings a little warmth to a room.<br><br>Whether you’re a collector or just starting out, I hope my work gives you a moment to pause. From small framed pieces to large paintings, each one is made slowly and on purpose.<br><br>Thank you again for joining. I can’t wait to share more with you.<br><br>Warmly,<br>Rosa",
                  "fontSize": "15px",
                  "fontFamily": {
                    "label": "Helvetica",
                    "value": "helvetica,sans-serif"
                  },
                  "color": "#1A1A1A",
                  "textAlign": "left",
                  "lineHeight": "160%",
                  "containerPadding": "8px 64px 8px"
                }
              },
